WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:17.940 --> 00:00:19.220
I need emergency assistance.

00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:20.760
(Over radio) Whats your location?

00:00:21.780 --> 00:00:23.340
Wind River Indian Reservation

00:00:28.120 --> 00:00:29.650
I'm June Banner

00:00:29.650 --> 00:00:31.340
FBI. Welcome to Wyoming.

00:00:31.940 --> 00:00:32.660
By yourself?

00:00:32.920 --> 00:00:33.580
It's just me.

00:00:34.020 --> 00:00:36.660
That's Cory Lambert, he's the one who found the body.

00:00:41.160 --> 00:00:42.100
This is a homocide.

00:00:42.360 --> 00:00:44.580
I knew that girl. She was a fighter.

00:00:50.540 --> 00:00:54.760
They gave six officers to cover an area the size of Rhode Island.

00:00:54.980 --> 00:00:56.020
Maybe you can help.

00:00:56.260 --> 00:00:57.100
Well I know what the tracks say.

00:00:57.480 --> 00:00:59.480
What is it that you do again?

00:00:59.780 --> 00:01:00.720
I hunt predators.

00:01:00.780 --> 00:01:01.420
(gunshot)

00:01:01.640 --> 00:01:04.340
So why don't you come hunt one for me then?

00:01:04.880 --> 00:01:05.580
(cocks gun)

00:01:09.600 --> 00:01:12.600
Why would a teenage girl be out will be out here? What was she running from?

00:01:13.420 --> 00:01:15.800
You're looking for clues. But youre missing all the signs.

00:01:19.200 --> 00:01:20.680
Shouldn't we wait for backup?

00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:25.140
This isn't the land of backup Jane. This is the land of you're on your own.

00:01:28.100 --> 00:01:29.380
Oh my God

00:01:32.200 --> 00:01:35.840
You won't get the answers you're looking for. No matter what you find.

00:01:37.040 --> 00:01:38.920
Why would your daughter run from home?

00:01:39.380 --> 00:01:40.980
I don't know why, she didn't tell me.

00:01:42.820 --> 00:01:45.200
Out here, you cannot blink, not ever.

00:01:46.360 --> 00:01:49.780
This place, what it takes from us.

00:01:50.860 --> 00:01:52.360
What it took from you.

00:01:52.880 --> 00:01:53.680
I got lucky.

00:01:54.420 --> 00:01:56.680
Luck, that lives in the city

00:01:56.700 --> 00:01:57.480
Get your hand off that weapon.

00:01:57.860 --> 00:01:58.380
Hey!

00:02:04.820 --> 00:02:05.560
Jane!

00:02:06.420 --> 00:02:08.100
Luck don't live out here.

